        </h2>
        
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 text-sm">
          <!-- Powder Card -->
          <div class="bg-black/40 border border-emerald-900/40 rounded-xl p-5 flex flex-col justify-between">
            <div>
              <div class="text-emerald-400 font-bold text-lg mb-2">1. Pure Raw Powder</div>
              <p class="text-xs text-gray-300 mb-4">
                <strong>Best for:</strong> Fitness enthusiasts, smoothies, natural green drinks, and rapid bioavailable absorption.
              </p>
              <ul class="text-xs text-gray-400 space-y-1.5 mb-6">
                <li>• 100% sub-40°C micro-fine 300 mesh</li>
                <li>• Mixes easily with lemon water</li>
                <li>• Highest value per gram of protein</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
            <a href="/product/sujata-spirulina-powder" class="w-full text-center bg-emerald-700 hover:bg-emerald-600 text-white font-bold py-2.5 px-4 rounded-lg text-xs transition-colors">
              View Spirulina Powder (₹350)
            </a>
          </div>

          <!-- Tablets Card -->
          <div class="bg-black/40 border border-emerald-900/40 rounded-xl p-5 flex flex-col justify-between">
            <div>
              <div class="text-emerald-400 font-bold text-lg mb-2">2. 100% Vegan Tablets</div>
              <p class="text-xs text-gray-300 mb-4">
