      <!-- Section 4: The Synergistic Ultimate Combo -->
      <section class="bg-gradient-to-r from-[#031d16] via-[#0A2E23] to-[#031d16] border-2 border-emerald-400/50 rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-2xl">
        <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-6">
          <div class="max-w-xl">
            <span class="inline-block bg-amber-500/20 text-amber-300 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider px-3 py-1 rounded-full mb-3 border border-amber-400/30">
              ⚡ Doctor &amp; Practitioner Recommended
            </span>
            <h3 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-serif font-black text-white mb-2">
              The Daily Super Immunity Combo (Spirulina + Sea Buckthorn)
            </h3>
            <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-emerald-100/90 leading-relaxed mb-4">
              When sub-40°C cryo-milled Spirulina (complete plant protein, iron, phycocyanin) is paired with wild Himalayan Sea Buckthorn (rare Omega-7, 3, 6, 9 and natural Vitamin C), bio-absorption increases by up to 300%. Protects cell membranes, boosts hemoglobin, and restores natural metabolic stamina.
            </p>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-300">
              <span>✓ Free Express Courier</span>
              <span>•</span>
              <span>✓ Cash on Delivery (COD)</span>
              <span>•</span>
              <span>✓ 30-Day Guarantee</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="shrink-0 text-center">
