            <div class="text-3xl font-black text-amber-400 mb-3">₹1,100</div>
            <a 
              href="/product/sujata-spirulina-sea-buckthorn-combo-pack" 
              class="inline-block bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-500 to-emerald-600 hover:from-emerald-400 hover:to-emerald-500 text-black font-black py-3 px-6 rounded-xl text-sm shadow-xl transition-transform active:scale-95"
            >
              Order Combo Pack Now →
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 5: Frequently Asked Questions (FAQPage) -->
      <section class="bg-[#0A1A12] border border-emerald-900/50 rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-xl">
        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-serif font-bold text-white mb-6">
          Frequently Asked Questions on Spirulina in India
        </h2>

        <div class="space-y-4 text-sm">
          <details class="bg-black/30 border border-white/5 rounded-xl p-4 cursor-pointer group">
            <summary class="font-bold text-emerald-300 text-sm list-none flex items-center justify-between">
              <span>Why does commercial spirulina smell so bad?</span>
